{
 "description": "Bridge activity over a window. Read from the Ethereum side: base and optimism deposits with the ETH they carry, and withdrawals proven and finalized (count only, the events carry no value: valueEth null); arbitrum as L1 to L2 message count only (no value, no withdrawals); polygon_pos, the Polygon PoS bridge predicates: deposit and withdrawal_finalized of ETH and WETH with valueEth, of USDC, USDT and DAI as deposit_usd and withdrawal_finalized_usd with valueUsd, of any other token as deposit_token and withdrawal_finalized_token (count only). Read from the BNB Chain side: opbnb, the opBNB portal, deposits with the BNB they carry (valueBnb) and withdrawals proven and finalized (count only). window in hours, default 24, max 720; each hour is published about 90 minutes after it ends. Omit l2 for all five. Price: 2 cents per call.",
